# About this devlog

This site is the development log for **hamham**. It collects short updates about the work in progress, experiments, and decisions behind the game.

The [latest devlog]($link.page('devlog/2026')) is organized by year. You can also [browse the archive]($link.page('devlog')) or [subscribe to its RSS feed]($link.page('devlog').alternative('rss')).

New to the game? The [WHAM! BAM! HAM-HAM! Player Guide]($link.page('guides')) covers match rules, Campaign Mode, cards, Heroes, and collection features.

The site is built with [Zine](https://zine-ssg.io/) and published with GitHub Pages.
